        "text": "<h2><strong>Sterling Silver<br/></strong></h2><p>Sterling silver has a directness we ave always loved. It feels sharp and sculptural without becoming overstated.<br/><br/>For MARCO DAL MASO, silver is not a secondary option. It sits at the center of how we design, from everyday essentials to more expressive pieces like the<a href=\"https://marcodalmaso.com/products/lash-leather-braid-ring-silver-blue-leather-agan33-01bvpb\" target=\"_blank\"> LASH Ring with Braided Blue Leather in Oxidized Silver</a>, as well as styles across our wider <a href=\"https://marcodalmaso.com/collections\" target=\"_blank\">collections</a>.<br/><br/>For a clean, structured look, sterling silver often feels immediate. It works especially well when the focus is on form, contrast, and surface.</p>",
