          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The answer depends less on rules and more on how the piece will be worn.<br/></p><ul><li>Choose sterling silver if you want a sharper, more architectural presence, made for daily wear.</li><li>Choose gold vermeil if you want warmth and a more elevated finish, especially in signets, bracelets, or necklaces where tone changes the mood of the piece.</li><li>Choose solid gold if you are buying for legacy or a milestone moment.</li></ul><p>If you are choosing your first MARCO DAL MASO pieces, the question is less where to begin than what you want them to say together. Our work is made to be combined - silver against vermeil, a signet worn with a chain, a cuff that answers a ring. Because we plate in the same 18 karat we use in solid gold, tone carries across materials, so a set can be built over time without ever looking assembled.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "spacer_EWdBkt": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "heading_AVfK9N": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "A note on wear and longevity",
            "tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_TEtx3h": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every material ages differently. Sterling silver can tarnish naturally over time, though on our oxidized finishes, that darker tone is intentional rather than something to polish away. </p><p>Gold vermeil is 18kt gold over solid sterling silver, plated to a minimum of five microns. At that thickness the finish is durable rather than delicate, though like any gold surface it will soften gradually with years of daily wear.  <br/><br/>A little care goes a long way. See our <a href=\"https://marcodalmaso.com/pages/support-center#product-care\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://marcodalmaso.com/pages/support-center#product-care\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Product Care guide</span></a> for cleaning and storage tips, or <a href=\"https://marcodalmaso.com/collections\" title=\"https://marcodalmaso.com/collections\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">explore our collections</span> </a>to find the material that fits you.</p>"
          }
        },
